<title>GERMANY: DG Bank 9-mo oper profit up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>DG Bank 9-mo oper profit up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HOHENKAMMER, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Oper profit before provisions	  486     up 17 pct</p>
<p>    Partial operating profit		 314     vs 259</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German cooperative bank is Deutsche Genossenschaftsbank. Partial operating profit comprises net interest and commission income minus operating costs. The bank also said that at group level, operating profit before risk provisions rose by more than 10 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
